%!PS
% Make the PDF: gswin64c -dBATCH -dNOPAUSE -dQUIET -dSAFER -sDEVICE=pdfwrite -dCompatibilityLevel=1.4 -sOutputFile=layout.pdf layout.ps
% Synthetic layout test document for PrismQDA's PDF import. All text is invented.
% Page 1: two columns, read column by column. Page 2: ligatures, a superscript, a table, fake bold.

/Enc ISOLatin1Encoding 256 array copy def
Enc 45 /hyphen put
Enc 12 /fi put
Enc 13 /fl put

/Body
  /Times-Roman findfont dup length dict begin
  { 1 index /FID ne { def } { pop pop } ifelse } forall
  /Encoding Enc def currentdict end
  /BodyL1 exch definefont pop
/BodyL1 findfont 11 scalefont def
/Small /BodyL1 findfont 7 scalefont def
/Bold /Times-Bold findfont 11 scalefont def

/At { moveto show } def   % usage: (text) x y At

% ---------------- page 1: two columns ----------------
Body setfont
(Left column, first paragraph. The committee met on a Tuesday evening in the) 72 700 At
(church hall and counted the chairs twice before anyone arrived.) 72 687 At

(Left column, second paragraph. Nobody had brought a pen, so the minutes) 72 661 At
(were written on the back of a tea towel.) 72 648 At

(Right column, first paragraph. The harvest festival was held in the barn,) 320 700 At
(and the youngest children were put in charge of the apples.) 320 687 At

(Right column, second paragraph. By nine o'clock the last pie was gone.) 320 661 At
showpage

% ---------------- page 2 ----------------
Body setfont
(The \014nal \015oor plan was ready before the second meeting.) 72 700 At
(The result was significant) 72 686 At
Small setfont (2) show
Body setfont ( in later tests, as the authors expected.) show

Bold setfont
(Overprinted heading) 72 660 At
(Overprinted heading) 72.25 660 At

Body setfont
(Name) 72 620 At (Group) 200 620 At (Score) 330 620 At
(Ana) 72 606 At (control) 200 606 At (41) 330 606 At
(Ben) 72 592 At (treatment) 200 592 At (57) 330 592 At
(Cleo) 72 578 At (treatment) 200 578 At (63) 330 578 At

(Table 1 shows the scores for each group.) 72 540 At
showpage
